{
  "name": "Fullyo \u2014 Telegram AI Assistant",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "t001",
      "name": "Telegram Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegramTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        240,
        300
      ],
      "webhookId": "fullyo-telegram-assistant",
      "credentials": {
        "telegramApi": {
          "id": "CRED_ID_TELEGRAM",
          "name": "Fullyo Telegram Bot"
        }
      },
      "parameters": {
        "updates": [
          "message",
          "callback_query"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "t002",
      "name": "Security Check",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        460,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForAllItems",
        "jsCode": "const msg = $input.first().json;\nconst OWNER_ID = 8609472348;\n\n// Handle both messages and callback queries\nconst fromId = msg.message?.from?.id || msg.callback_query?.from?.id;\nconst text = msg.message?.text || msg.callback_query?.data || '';\nconst chatId = msg.message?.chat?.id || msg.callback_query?.message?.chat?.id;\nconst messageId = msg.message?.message_id || msg.callback_query?.message?.message_id;\nconst callbackQueryId = msg.callback_query?.id || null;\n\nif (fromId !== OWNER_ID) {\n  return [{ json: { authorized: false, chatId, text, fromId } }];\n}\n\nreturn [{ json: { authorized: true, chatId, text, fromId, messageId, callbackQueryId } }];"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "t003",
      "name": "Is Authorized?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        680,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.authorized }}",
              "rightValue": true,
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "t004",
      "name": "Detect Intent",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        900,
        200
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForAllItems",
        "jsCode": "const { text, chatId, callbackQueryId, messageId } = $input.first().json;\nconst lower = (text || '').toLowerCase().trim();\n\nlet intent = 'create_post'; // DEFAULT\n\nif (lower === '/start' || lower === '/help' || lower === 'help' || lower === 'hi' || lower === 'hello') {\n  intent = 'help';\n} else if (lower === 'status' || lower === 'report' || lower === '/status') {\n  intent = 'status';\n} else if (lower.startsWith('yes') || lower === 'y' || lower === 'approve' || lower === 'post it' || lower === 'go ahead' || lower === 'ok' || lower === 'looks good' || lower === 'send it' || lower === 'publish') {\n  intent = 'approve';\n} else if (lower.startsWith('no') || lower === 'n' || lower === 'cancel' || lower === 'discard' || lower === 'stop' || lower === 'delete') {\n  intent = 'reject';\n}\n\nreturn [{ json: { intent, text, chatId, callbackQueryId, messageId } }];"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "t006",
      "name": "Send Help Message",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        1340,
        80
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "telegramApi": {
          "id": "CRED_ID_TELEGRAM",
          "name": "Fullyo Telegram Bot"
        }
      },
      "parameters": {
        "chatId": "={{ $json.chatId }}",
        "text": "\ud83d\udc4b *Fullyo AI Assistant* \u2014 ready.\n\nHere's what you can say:\n\n\ud83d\udcdd *Create a post:*\n_\"SkyHouse \u2014 we have availability April 20-25, create urgency post\"_\n_\"Post about E\u00f1o taking guests on a sunset boat charter\"_\n_\"Moroccan Palace \u2014 romantic getaway post\"_\n\n\ud83d\udcca *Get status:*\n_\"Status\"_ or _\"Report\"_\n\nJust type naturally \u2014 I understand context.",
        "additionalFields": {
          "parse_mode": "Markdown"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "t007",
      "name": "Send Status",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        1340,
        220
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "telegramApi": {
          "id": "CRED_ID_TELEGRAM",
          "name": "Fullyo Telegram Bot"
        }
      },
      "parameters": {
        "chatId": "={{ $json.chatId }}",
        "text": "\ud83d\udcca *Fullyo \u2014 Automation Status*\n\n*Social Media Automation:*\n\u2705 SkyHouse Sayulita \u2014 Daily Facebook posts active (11am MX time)\n\u23f3 Moroccan Palace \u2014 Not yet set up\n\u23f3 Casa Sempre Avanti \u2014 Not yet set up\n\u23f3 LUX Property Management \u2014 Not yet set up\n\u23f3 Villas Sempre Avanti \u2014 Not yet set up\n\n*Integrations:*\n\u2705 Bunny CDN \u2014 SkyHouse + Sayulita photos\n\u2705 Claude AI \u2014 Caption generation\n\u2705 Facebook Graph API \u2014 Publishing\n\u23f3 Instagram \u2014 Pending account setup\n\u23f3 ManyChat \u2014 Comment automation (set up in progress)\n\u23f3 GHL \u2014 Lead capture (Phase 3)\n\n*Next priority:* Set up Moroccan Palace workflow",
        "additionalFields": {
          "parse_mode": "Markdown"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "t008",
      "name": "Generate Post with Claude",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1340,
        360
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "CRED_ID_ANTHROPIC",
          "name": "Anthropic API"
        }
      },
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.anthropic.com/v1/messages",
        "authentication": "predefinedCredentialType",
        "nodeCredentialType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "anthropic-version",
              "value": "2023-06-01"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "contentType": "raw",
        "rawContentType": "application/json",
        "body": "={{ JSON.stringify({ model: 'claude-opus-4-6', max_tokens: 1024, system: 'You are the social media content creator for SkyHouse Sayulita, a luxury vacation rental in Sayulita Mexico. Write Facebook posts that get published automatically.\\n\\nSkyHouse: 3 bed/3 bath/sleeps 8, panoramic ocean views, shared infinity pool, private tennis court, Starlink WiFi, 3-min walk to beach. Host E\u00f1o offers surf lessons, boat charters, ATV tours.\\n\\nBRAND VOICE: Elegant, experiential, warm. Plain text only. No markdown. No nightly rates. Never claim private beach or private pool. 100-200 words. Hashtags at end only.\\n\\nOutput ONLY the post text. No explanations, no questions, no commentary.', messages: [{ role: 'user', content: $json.text }] }) }}"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "t009",
      "name": "Parse Claude Response",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1560,
        360
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForAllItems",
        "jsCode": "const response = $input.first().json;\nconst chatId = $('Detect Intent').first().json.chatId;\nconst originalText = $('Detect Intent').first().json.text;\n\nlet postText = '';\nif (response.content && response.content[0]) {\n  postText = response.content[0].text.trim();\n}\n\nif (!postText) {\n  throw new Error('Claude returned empty response');\n}\n\n// Save pending post to static data so approval step can retrieve it\nconst staticData = $getWorkflowStaticData('global');\nstaticData.pendingPost = postText;\nstaticData.pendingChatId = chatId;\n\nreturn [{ json: { postText, chatId, originalRequest: originalText } }];"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "t010",
      "name": "Send for Approval",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        1780,
        360
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "telegramApi": {
          "id": "CRED_ID_TELEGRAM",
          "name": "Fullyo Telegram Bot"
        }
      },
      "parameters": {
        "chatId": "={{ $json.chatId }}",
        "text": "={{ '\u270d\ufe0f *Draft post ready:*\\n\\n' + $json.postText + '\\n\\nReply *yes* to post to Facebook now, or *no* to discard.' }}",
        "additionalFields": {
          "parse_mode": "Markdown"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "t011",
      "name": "Ignore Unauthorized",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.noOp",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        900,
        420
      ],
      "parameters": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "t012",
      "name": "Weekly Status Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        240,
        560
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "cronExpression",
              "expression": "0 14 * * 1"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "t013",
      "name": "Send Weekly Summary",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        460,
        560
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "telegramApi": {
          "id": "CRED_ID_TELEGRAM",
          "name": "Fullyo Telegram Bot"
        }
      },
      "parameters": {
        "chatId": "8609472348",
        "text": "\u2600\ufe0f *Good morning Seb \u2014 Weekly Automation Check-in*\n\n*This week:*\n\u2705 SkyHouse Sayulita posted daily on Facebook\n\n*Action items to consider:*\n\u2022 Set up next business (Moroccan Palace)\n\u2022 Check ManyChat comment automation\n\u2022 Review Facebook page insights\n\u2022 Upload new photos to Bunny CDN if needed\n\n*Reminder:* Reply with any post idea and I'll draft and publish it instantly.\n\n_Have a great week!_",
        "additionalFields": {
          "parse_mode": "Markdown"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "t014",
      "name": "Is Post Request?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1120,
        200
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": false
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.intent }}",
              "rightValue": "create_post",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "t015",
      "name": "Is Help?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1340,
        340
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": false
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.intent }}",
              "rightValue": "help",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "t016",
      "name": "Handle Approval",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1120,
        480
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForAllItems",
        "jsCode": "const staticData = $getWorkflowStaticData('global');\nconst chatId = $input.first().json.chatId;\nconst postText = staticData.pendingPost || null;\n\nif (!postText) {\n  return [{ json: { chatId, error: 'No pending post found. Please create a new post first.' } }];\n}\n\n// Clear pending post\nstaticData.pendingPost = null;\n\nreturn [{ json: { chatId, postText, hasPendingPost: true } }];"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "t017",
      "name": "Handle Rejection",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1120,
        600
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForAllItems",
        "jsCode": "const staticData = $getWorkflowStaticData('global');\nconst chatId = $input.first().json.chatId;\nstaticData.pendingPost = null;\nreturn [{ json: { chatId, message: 'Post discarded. Send me a new idea whenever you\\'re ready.' } }];"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "t018",
      "name": "Post Approved to Facebook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1340,
        480
      ],
      "credentials": {
